==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|*hoggewasch}} (found only as {{cog|enm|hoggyswasch|lit=hog's wash|t=refuse of the kitchen for feeding pigs}}), equivalent to {{af|en|hog|wash}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhɒɡ.wɒʃ/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhɔɡ.wɑʃ/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhɑɡ.wɑʃ/|a=cot-caught}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-hogwash.ogg|a=US,cot-caught}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɒɡwɒʃ|s=2}}

